      "content": "We can reframe the narrative to emphasize the profound change already achieved rather than the completion percentage. Focus on the depth of impact: \"Overcoming extreme environmental hurdles, our team has secured life-changing, sustainable water access for nearly 20,000 lives in the Sahel.\" Highlighting the overcoming of \"extreme environmental hurdles\" gracefully addresses the delays while framing the delivery as an incredible triumph. This positions your team as resilient leaders driving massive change.",
